Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Salesman phone se hi visit aur order record kar sakta hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.61,0:00:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ek customer pe pahunche, app kholiye, customer select kariye, Record Visit dabaaein.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.84,0:00:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Location automatic capture ho jaati hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.33,0:00:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Agar order milta hai — Create Order dabaaiye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.13,0:00:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Items add kariye, quantity daaliye, submit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.81,0:00:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeh order Tally mein bhi automatically sync ho jaayega raat ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.73,0:00:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Digital record milta hai — kab kaun kahaan gaya, kya bik gaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.59,0:00:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Owner ke liye transparency, salesman ke liye productivity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.20,0:00:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabka fayda.
